		<wp:meta_value><![CDATA[a:12:{s:13:"5db720c26e8cf";O:8:"stdClass":6:{s:4:"node";s:13:"5db720c26e8cf";s:4:"type";s:6:"module";s:6:"parent";s:13:"5db72251249c7";s:8:"position";i:0;s:8:"settings";O:8:"stdClass":45:{s:4:"text";s:4020:"<span style="font-size: 20pt;"><b><span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans';">Support the <em>Door County Land Trust</em> today!</span></b></span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;">A donation to the <em>Door County Land Trust</em> helps protect Door County’s exceptional lands and waters…<em>forever</em>. By making a donation to the <em>Door County Land Trust</em> you will join more than 4,200 other Land Trust supporter households who care about the current and future well-being of Door County.</span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;"><b>Donations are used to:</b></span>
<ul>
 	<li><span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;">permanently protect Door County’s rural and natural heritage and its unique and fragile wildlife habitat;</span></li>
 	<li><span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;">educate the community about the importance of land protection; and</span></li>
 	<li><span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;">make land available to the public for hiking, cross-country skiing, canoeing, hunting, fishing, and the quiet contemplation of nature.</span></li>
</ul>
<a href="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/renew-my-membership/"><span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;"><b>Renew My Membership</b></span></a><span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;"><b> or <a href="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/join-the-land-trust/">Join the Land Trust</a></b></span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;">Membership dollars are used for land acquisition, stewardship and restoration on the nature preserves, volunteer projects, and educational activities and events. Begin your membership today with an annual or monthly gift.</span>

<a href="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/give-a-tribute-or-memorial-gift/"><span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;"><b>Give a Tribute or Memorial Gift</b></span></a>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;">When you make a gift to the Door County Land Trust honoring a friend, family member, a special event, or the life of a loved one, your gift lasts as long as the land does – forever!</span>

<a href="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/give-generously/membership-and-giving/stock-gifts/"><span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;"><b>Stock Gifts</b></span></a>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;">Making a gift of stock or securities is as easy as picking up the phone. <a href="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/give-generously/membership-and-giving/stock-gifts/">Click here</a> for necessary information for your broker.</span>

<a href="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/give-generously/planned-giving/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;"><b>The Legacy Circle: Planned Giving</b></span></a>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;">By letting us know of your intention to make a gift through your will, trust, annuity, insurance or other planned or deferred means, you become a member of the <em>Door County Land Trust </em><b>Legacy Circle</b>. Giving to the <em>Door County Land Trust</em> through your estate plan is a wonderful way to leave a legacy of honoring the natural world</span>

<a href="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/give-generously/membership-and-giving/business-membership/"><span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;"><b>Business Membership</b></span></a>

