		<wp:meta_value><![CDATA[a:17:{s:13:"5db72767bc491";O:8:"stdClass":6:{s:4:"node";s:13:"5db72767bc491";s:4:"type";s:6:"module";s:6:"parent";s:13:"5db727dea38bc";s:8:"position";i:0;s:8:"settings";O:8:"stdClass":51:{s:4:"text";s:3800:"<span style="font-size: 20pt; font-family: 'quattrocento sans';"><b>Join the <em>Door County Land Trust</em> today!</b></span>

<span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'quattrocento sans';">As a member of the Door County Land Trust, you receive the following benefits:</span>
<ul>
 	<li><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'quattrocento sans';">The Land Trust journal, <strong><em>Landings</em></strong>, and other newsletters that highlight Door County’s exceptional lands and waters</span></li>
 	<li><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'quattrocento sans';">Opportunities to explore Land Trust-protected properties</span></li>
 	<li><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'quattrocento sans';">Invitations to Land Trust-sponsored events</span></li>
 	<li><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'quattrocento sans';">Rewarding volunteer opportunities</span></li>
 	<li><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'quattrocento sans';">A connection with others who share a similar passion for Door County’s wild places and open spaces</span></li>
 	<li><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'quattrocento sans';">And best of all, the satisfaction of being part of a solution to protect Door County’s most important resource…the land itself!</span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: 'quattrocento sans';">In addition to the benefits listed above, contributors at the <em>Northern White Cedar Giving Circle,</em> <em>Grand Peninsula Society, </em>and<em> Bright Horizon Society</em> levels also receive invitations to special hikes and updates on the latest Land Trust news. </span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;"><b>Sign up for a one year membership available at the following levels:</b></span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 16px; color: #547c58;"><b>     Partner </b>($35-$149)</span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 16px; color: #547c58;"><b>     Preserver </b>($150-$249)</span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 16px; color: #547c58;"><b>     Steward </b>($250-$499)</span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 16px; color: #547c58;"><b>     Guardian </b>($500-$999)</span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 16px; color: #547c58;"><b>     Northern White Cedar Giving Circle </b>($1,000-$9,999)</span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 16px; color: #547c58;"><b>     Grand Peninsula Society </b>($10,000+)</span>

<span style="color: #547c58; font-size: 16px;"><strong>     Bright Horizon Society </strong> ($20,000+)</span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt; color: #547c58;"><b>
<span style="font-size: 20pt; color: #547c58;">Two Ways to Join:</span></b></span>

<span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #547c58;">Annual Membership Contribution </span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;">To join, <a href="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/join-the-land-trust/">donate online</a> or send us your <a href="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/Membership_contribution.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">membership form</a> to make a donation at the membership level of your choice. Each year, you will receive a letter inviting you to renew your membership.</span>

<span style="font-size: 16pt; color: #547c58;">Evergreen Giving (Recurring Monthly Giving)</span>

<span style="font-family: 'quattrocento sans'; font-size: 14pt;"><a href="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/join-the-land-trust/">Monthly giving</a> adds up! You can give your membership donation with a gift of any amount set to recur on a monthly basis.</span>";s:5:"color";s:0:"";s:10:"typography";a:11:{s:11:"font_family";s:7:"Default";s:11:"font_weight";s:7:"default";s:9:"font_size";a:2:{s:6:"length";s:0:"";s:4:"unit";s:2:"px";}s:11:"line_height";a:2:{s:6:"length";s:0:"";s:4:"unit";s:0:"";}s:10:"text_align";s:0:"";s:14:"letter_spacing";a:2:{s:6:"length";s:0:"";s:4:"unit";s:2:"px";}s:14:"text_transform";s:0:"";s:15:"text_decoration";s:0:"";s:10:"font_style";s:0:"";s:12:"font_variant";s:0:"";s:11:"text_shadow";a:4:{s:5:"color";s:0:"";s:10:"horizontal";s:0:"";s:8:"vertical";s:0:"";s:4:"blur";s:0:"";}}s:16:"typography_large";a:9:{s:9:"font_size";a:2:{s:6:"length";s:0:"";s:4:"unit";s:2:"px";}s:11:"line_height";a:2:{s:6:"length";s:0:"";s:4:"unit";s:0:"";}s:10:"text_align";s:0:"";s:14:"letter_spacing";a:2:{s:6:"length";s:0:"";s:4:"unit";s:2:"px";}s:14:"text_transform";s:0:"";s:15:"text_decoration";s:0:"";s:10:"font_style";s:0:"";s:12:"font_variant";s:0:"";s:11:"text_shadow";a:4:{s:5:"color";s:0:"";s:10:"horizontal";s:0:"";s:8:"vertical";s:0:"";s:4:"blur";s:0:"";}}s:17:"typography_medium";a:9:{s:9:"font_size";a:2:{s:6:"length";s:0:"";s:4:"unit";s:2:"px";}s:11:"line_height";a:2:{s:6:"length";s:0:"";s:4:"unit";s:0:"";}s:10:"text_align";s:0:"";s:14:"letter_spacing";a:2:{s:6:"length";s:0:"";s:4:"unit";s:2:"px";}s:14:"text_transform";s:0:"";s:15:"text_decoration";s:0:"";s:10:"font_style";s:0:"";s:12:"font_variant";s:0:"";s:11:"text_shadow";a:4:{s:5:"color";s:0:"";s:10:"horizontal";s:0:"";s:8:"vertical";s:0:"";s:4:"blur";s:0:"";}}s:21:"typography_responsive";a:9:{s:9:"font_size";a:2:{s:6:"length";s:0:"";s:4:"unit";s:2:"px";}s:11:"line_height";a:2:{s:6:"length";s:0:"";s:4:"unit";s:0:"";}s:10:"text_align";s:0:"";s:14:"letter_spacing";a:2:{s:6:"length";s:0:"";s:4:"unit";s:2:"px"