<h2>
		Richter Community Forest <br />Nature Preserve
	</h2>
	<p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/300+Green+Bay+Rd,+Washington,+WI+54246/@45.3419933,-86.9556331,15z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x4d4d1bf98ae87a85:0xeeba1347906f0849!8m2!3d45.3419933!4d-86.9468784" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>300 Green Bay Road, Washington Island</b></a></p>
