		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:fl-builder/layout -->
<h2>Making a donation by text message is safe, secure and the fastest way to give.</h2>
<p>To begin, send a text message to <b>1-920-542-6247</b> with the dollar amount you'd like to donate in the message.</p>
<p><img src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/step1_-169x300.jpg" alt="" width="169" height="300" /></p>
<p>You'll receive a text reply with a link to complete your donation, contact and billing information. Click "process" after you have entered your information.</p>
<p><img src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/step2_-169x300.jpg" alt="" width="169" height="300" />  <img src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/step3-169x300.png" alt="" width="169" height="300" />    <img src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/step4-169x300.jpg" alt="" width="169" height="300" />   <img src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/step5-169x300.jpg" alt="" width="169" height="300" /></p>
<p>You'll receive a verification text as well as a receipt by email.  Your donation is complete!</p>
<p>If you wish to create a recurring monthly gift, text "repeat."</p>
<p><img src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/step6_-169x300.jpg" alt="" width="169" height="300" />  <img src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/step7_-169x300.jpg" alt="" width="169" height="300" />   <img src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/step8_-169x300.jpg" alt="" width="169" height="300" /></p>
<p><a href="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/ltrdh_quickguide__.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><b>Click here</b> </a>for a printable version of these instructions!</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<!-- /wp:fl-builder/layout -->]]></content:encoded>
