		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:fl-builder/layout -->
<h1>2024 Door County BIG PLANT</h1>
<p><em>Door County Land Trust is pleased to support the Climate Change Coalition of Door County and their effort to plant more than 10,000 trees in 2024!</em></p>
<p><img title="Red Pine Tray of 18" src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Red-Pine-Tray-of-18.jpg" alt="Red Pine Tray of 18" width="1280" height="1280" /></p>
<p>4 tree types available. Purchase 3" potted tree seedling by the flat. Each flat is <strong>$54 </strong>and holds <em>18 two-year-old trees of a single species. </em>Plant at your business, home, or nonprofit. Or buy them to help distribute in your neighborhood.</p>
<hr />
<p>Please <a href="https://secure.doorcountylandtrust.org/events-registration-merchandise/shop/big-plant-order-form/"><strong><u>order</u></strong></a> by <strong><em>April 4</em></strong>. First-come, first-serve. Available for pick up <strong>April 16-22.</strong></p>
<p><strong><a href="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/2024-Tree-cards-The-Big-Plant.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><u>Click here to read more about the preferred planting conditions for each tree species.</u></a></strong></p>
<p><a href="https://secure.doorcountylandtrust.org/events-registration-merchandise/shop/big-plant-order-form/" target="_self" rel="noopener"> <img title="BalsamFir" src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/BalsamFir.jpg" alt="BalsamFir" width="521" height="644" /> </a></p>
<h2><a title="Balsam Fir" href="https://secure.doorcountylandtrust.org/events-registration-merchandise/shop/big-plant-order-form/" target="_self" rel="noopener"> Balsam Fir </a></h2>
<p><a href="https://secure.doorcountylandtrust.org/events-registration-merchandise/shop/big-plant-order-form/" target="_self" rel="noopener"> <img title="RedPine" src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/RedPine.jpg" alt="RedPine" width="489" height="625" /> </a></p>
<h2><a title="Red Pine" href="https://secure.doorcountylandtrust.org/events-registration-merchandise/shop/big-plant-order-form/" target="_self" rel="noopener"> Red Pine </a></h2>
<p><a href="https://secure.doorcountylandtrust.org/events-registration-merchandise/shop/big-plant-order-form/" target="_self" rel="noopener"> <img title="WhiteSpruce" src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/WhiteSpruce.jpg" alt="WhiteSpruce" width="489" height="625" /> </a></p>
<h2><a title="White Spruce" href="https://secure.doorcountylandtrust.org/events-registration-merchandise/shop/big-plant-order-form/" target="_self" rel="noopener"> White Spruce </a></h2>
<p><a href="https://secure.doorcountylandtrust.org/events-registration-merchandise/shop/big-plant-order-form/" target="_self" rel="noopener"> <img title="WhitePine" src="https://www.doorcountylandtrust.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/WhitePine.jpg" alt="WhitePine" width="489" height="625" /> </a></p>
<h2><a title="White Pine" href="https://secure.doorcountylandtrust.org/events-registration-merchandise/shop/big-plant-order-form/" target="_self" rel="noopener"> White Pine </a></h2>
<p><a href="https://secure.doorcountylandtrust.org/events-registration-merchandise/shop/big-plant-order-form/" target="_self" rel="noopener"> &gt;&gt; Click Here to place your order </a></p>
<hr />
<p>Coordinated by Climate Change Coalition of Door County and executed by 80+ amazing tree-planting community partners.</p>
<p>→ Queries &amp; requests: email<strong> Jeff at jeff@lnrp.org</strong></p>
